{"id":"sortant","lemma":"sortant","pos":"adj","rank":2773,"glosses":["outgoing (still in office but due to be replaced)"],"ipa":"/sɔʁ.tɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-sortant.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-sortant.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"sortante","masculinePlural":"sortants","femininePlural":"sortantes"},"examples":[{"text":"Ferme la porte en sortant.","en":"Close the door when you leave.","words":[{"g":"to shut","l":"fermer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Est-ce que tu peux fermer la porte en sortant ?","en":"Can you shut the door on your way out?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to shut"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"in / of it"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"what"]]},{"text":"N'oublie pas de fermer la porte en sortant.","en":"Don't forget to close the door on your way out.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to forget","l":"oublier"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to shut"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Payez la caissière en sortant.","en":"Pay the cashier on the way out.","words":[{"g":"to pay","l":"payer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"cashier","l":"caissier"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"N'oubliez pas d'éteindre le gaz en sortant.","en":"Don't forget to turn off the gas before going out.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to forget","l":"oublier"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to turn off"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"gas"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]}]}